# Local working data — market caches and read-only snapshots of live trading
# databases. Never commit these: the bot databases contain real account activity.
_cache/
_live/
*.db

# The corpus study's downloaded bars. Tens of megabytes of vendor data that is not
# mine to redistribute. Reproducibility comes from the fingerprints recorded next to
# every verdict, and from corpus/results.csv, which is text and diffable.
corpus/data/
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Live strategy ports and their runners. These encode real trading parameters,
# traded instruments, position sizing and database paths for money that is actually
# at risk. The library is public; what you point it at is not.
private/

